; ZacOS 9 Views at 1.25x: the font for 1.25x screens (see
; tools/fonts/build_scaled_fonts.py). Drafted by that script from
; platinum-views-9.pfont, and meant to be touched up by hand: it isn't
; regenerated over (but with --force). Same format as the 1x font;
; every glyph drawn at the screen's pixels.

font ZacOS 9 Views 1.25x
height 19
baseline 14
cap 10
xheight 7

